## 5. Development Workflow

1. **Changing Version / Releasing**:
   - Update version info in [versioning.properties](file:///e:/Projects/minecraft-datapack/versioning.properties).
   - Update [CHANGELOG.md](file:///e:/Projects/minecraft-datapack/CHANGELOG.md) using the "Keep a Changelog" format (Added, Changed, Deprecated, Removed, Fixed, Security).
   - Run the package script `python package_datapack.py` to create the release ZIP in `releases/`.

2. **Referencing Original Assets**:
   - The original assets for MineColonies are extracted inside [backups/minecolonies-extracted/](file:///e:/Projects/minecraft-datapack/backups/minecolonies-extracted), and the full vanilla 1.19.2 data assets are located inside [backups/vanilla-1.19.2/](file:///e:/Projects/minecraft-datapack/backups/vanilla-1.19.2) for reference and comparison.
   - Always consult these folders before designing or modifying datapack overrides to ensure directory structures, namespaces, file names, schemas, and default values are 100% correct.
   - All these files (and any source JARs) reside inside the [backups/](file:///e:/Projects/minecraft-datapack/backups) folder, which is configured in `.gitignore` to prevent committing them to the repository.

